@notification = https://localhost:7252
@carriers = https://localhost:7049

### 1. merchant-1 registers a webhook (pointing at the mock merchant): 201, with a secret
PUT {{notification}}/merchants/merchant-1/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://localhost:7049/merchant-hooks/merchant-1" }

### 2. What the mock merchant received
GET {{carriers}}/merchant-hooks/merchant-1

### 3. The delivery log
GET {{notification}}/merchants/merchant-1/deliveries

### 4. Make the merchant's server fail every time
PUT {{carriers}}/admin/faults/merchant
Content-Type: application/json

{ "errorRate": 1.0 }

### 5. Fix the merchant's server
PUT {{carriers}}/admin/faults/merchant
Content-Type: application/json

{ }

### 6. Replay what was dead-lettered
POST {{notification}}/admin/dead-letters/replay